otation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"7處獨立位置，7個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-sanguozhi-060-heqi"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"life_events":[{"id":"le-wu060-heqi0","person_id":"yro_665_hng","event_type":"death","source_term":"反共殺升","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-060","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-heqi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-060-heqi","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-heqi:line011","quote":"　　賀齊字公苗，會稽山陰人也。少為郡吏，守剡長。縣吏斯從輕俠為奸，齊欲治之。主簿諫曰：“從，縣大族，山越所附，今日治之，明日寇至。”齊聞大怒，便立斬眾。從族黨遂相糾合，眾千餘人，舉兵攻縣。齊率吏民，開城門突擊，大破之，威震山越。後太末、豐浦民反，轉守太末長，誅惡養善，期用盡平。建安元年，孫策臨郡，察齊孝廉。時王朗奔東冶，侯官長商升為朗起兵。策遣永寧長韓晏領南部都尉，將兵討升，以齊為永寧長。晏為升所敗，齊又代晏領都尉事。升畏齊威名，遣使乞盟。齊因告喻，為陳禍福，升遂送上印綬，出捨求降。賊帥張雅、詹強等不願升降，反共殺升，雅稱無上將軍，強稱會稽太守。賊盛兵少，未足以討，齊住軍息兵。雅與女婿何雄爭勢兩乖，齊令越人因事交構。遂至疑隙，阻兵相圖。齊乃進討，一戰大破雅，強黨震懼，率眾出降。","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-heqi:line011:m0164"}],"interpretation_note":"本來源所記。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-heqi:line011:m0164","start":164,"end":166,"surface":"商升","kind":"person","person_id":"yro_665_hng","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-heqi:line011","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-heqi"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-heqi:line011:m0187","start":187,"end":188,"surfac